  "totalBlocks": 22,
  "translatedBlocks": 22,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59e3a6090a7aef2c",
      "translationZh": "TL;DR：在单个 DGX Spark / GB10 上的 Qwen3.8 Flash vLLM 配方。单流峰值 74 tok/s，普通请求 60–70 tok/s，8 路流达 212 tok/s，冷预填充比其衍生的配方快 2x–3.4x，完整 262K 上下文，且质量在噪声范围内与原始版本匹配。一切均为开放，包括原始逐轮数据和基准脚本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8731ad01d680485",
      "translationZh": "我见过的此模型的单 Spark 部署大多落在 35–45 tok/s 范围内，因此我花了几周时间弄清楚在 GB10 上每个 token 的时间实际花在哪里并进行了削减。如果你没有 Spark，中间部分的技巧仍然值得参考，因为它们大多适用于任何 MTP 或 speculative decoding（推测解码）设置。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07de6ac00595906b",
      "translationZh": "这是什么，用简单的话说",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c827a972fdc119e",
      "translationZh": "这是一个现成的服务设置。你构建容器，拉取公开权重，即可得到一个与 OpenAI 兼容的服务器，在单机上响应速度大幅提升。速度来源于模型自身的 draft head（草稿头）提前猜测若干 token，而完整模型在一次传递中检查所有猜测。猜中时，你以一步的代价获得若干 token；猜错时，会被完整模型的答案替换，因此输出质量不变。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d4a98cd5d30fba3",
      "translationZh": "峰值解码速度，每点工作负载相同，取 3 轮中的最佳结果：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84fe76e58d251d8c",
      "translationZh": "每步的 token 数在 1 到 8 路流之间保持在 3.65–3.94 之间，因此在批处理下推测不会失效。8 是其上限，因为这是配置的 max_num_seqs，且从 7 增加到 8 的收益降至 3%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51e93ff6f079d188",
      "translationZh": "冷启动提示，未缓存任何内容，每种情况重复三次：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9dfdfe40284e7b3b",
      "translationZh": "提示 此配方 原始配方 提升",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ff9444ba00c8ae8",
      "translationZh": "启用前缀缓存后，缓存的编码提示大约在 0.57 秒后开始回复，这就是让智能体循环感觉快速的原因。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1d887be49dc91bb",
      "translationZh": "实际上产生差异的是什么",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "678230604ec21188",
      "translationZh": "模型自身的 MTP 头部以密集方式运行，每个验证步骤大约产出 3.7 个 token。这是最大的杠杆。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22ae7d699ffe85aa",
      "translationZh": "我将草稿头部的词汇表从 248K 减少到 65K 个 ID。在 GB10 上，草稿通道受内存限制，每次草稿步骤读取完整词汇表头部会占用步骤时间的相当一部分。目标模型仍然针对完整词汇表进行验证，因此这只能改变速度，而不会影响输出。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "efe21849312306e6",
      "translationZh": "量化方案是对 MoE 专家使用 W4A16 AutoRound，对侧层使用 FP8，对 lm_head 使用 INT8。没有使用 3-bit 和 NVFP4，因为我希望速度来自服务路径，而不是通过更 aggressively 压缩权重来获得。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "37b2dfad4861b568",
      "translationZh": "有一个针对 GB10 调优的低延迟 GEMM，用于小规模解码时间的矩阵乘法，以及验证步骤中的无排序 top-k。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3161fe12f76fdbc4",
      "translationZh": "预填充的提升主要来源于更快的逐层嵌入表收集路径，这消除了预填充期间大量的串行页面错误。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbd3c240f9af879f",
      "translationZh": "综合来看，每个解码步骤从原始配方的 68.3 毫秒降低到针对智能体形状编码工作负载的 52.3 毫秒，相当于每秒多约 1.3 倍的步骤。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6acc7fae4645d0cc",
      "translationZh": "一件没有得到回报的事情：将预填充块加倍到 16,384 个 token 完全没有带来预填充增益，并且导致内存紧张到我决定放弃它。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5d013bffad21b54",
      "translationZh": "在两个种子上，固定的 492 题套件得分为 93.1% 和 93.3%，涵盖带有执行检查的代码、数学、知识、指令跟随、工具调用以及长上下文针对测试。我还对原始检查点进行了教师强制检查，top-1 一致性相比之前设定的 0.15 点噪声带仅变化了 0.06 点。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "486731feb6bff87d",
      "translationZh": "模型大约占用 71 GiB，KV 池为 16 GB，负载下仍有约 16 GiB 空闲。生成时，GPU 中位功耗约为 35–37 W，在长时间冷预填充时峰值接近 70 W，在浸泡运行期间未出现功率或热限制。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b0d4cf103da5106",
      "translationZh": "65K 草稿词汇表是基于英文和代码构建的，因此中文、日文和韩文的草稿输出质量较低且运行较慢。质量不受影响，因为完整模型仍会逐 token 进行检查。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32d3e044df56fe69",
      "translationZh": "基于 Saren-Arterius 的 qwen3.8-Flash-DGX-AutoRound 构建，因此要致谢。很高兴回答问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24bd11ff67c09897",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/DimeRhyme 提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
